  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Altamount Road known for?",
      "answer": "Altamount Road is known as one of Asia's most expensive streets, home to Antilia - the world's most expensive private residence owned by Mukesh Ambani - as well as several other ultra-luxury bungalows and residences of India's most prominent industrialists and business families. It is the pinnacle of Mumbai's residential prestige."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Altamount Road?",
      "answer": "Altamount Road uses the pin code 400026, shared with the adjacent Pedder Road, Kemps Corner and Breach Candy areas."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Altamount Road?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within and adjacent to Altamount Road are Kemps Corner, Cumballa Hill, Napeansea Road, Malabar Hill fringe, Warden Road, August Kranti Marg, and the Pedder Road junction."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Altamount Road?",
      "answer": "Property prices on Altamount Road are among the highest in Asia - ranging from ₹20 Cr for a premium apartment to ₹100 Cr+ for a bungalow plot. Antilia, the Ambani residence, is valued at over $1 billion. Rental rates for the few available properties range from ₹3 lakh to ₹10 lakh+ per month (as of May 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Altamount Road?",
      "answer": "Altamount Road is primarily served by private cars and taxis. The nearest Western Railway stations are Grant Road (15 min) and Charni Road (15 min). BEST bus routes 1, 83, 106 serve the area. The Bandra-Worli Sea Link is accessible via Haji Ali in 15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are near Altamount Road?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals near Altamount Road include Breach Candy Hospital, Jaslok Hospital, Hinduja Hospital, Wockhardt Hospital, and Saifee Hospital."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are near Altamount Road?",
      "answer": "Notable schools near Altamount Road include Campion School, Greenlawns High School, Walsingham House School, Cathedral & John Connon School, and Dhirubhai Ambani International School."
    },
    {
